[PrintTextModified Text:——当艾玛再次睁开眼睛时，<br>发现自己躺在医务室的床上。|#0103Adv17_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……艾玛小姐，你终于醒了……！|#0103Adv17_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露站在床边，<br>一脸担忧地看着艾玛。|#0103Adv17_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:抱歉，看来我的身体还没有完全恢复……|#0103Adv17_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你整整睡了一天呢。<br>看来身体真的到极限了……|#0103Adv17_Meruru002| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（整整一天……我竟然昏迷了这么久）|#0103Adv17_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:不能这样勉强自己啊……<br>要是艾玛小姐出了什么事的话，我……|#0103Adv17_Meruru003| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的双手紧紧握住艾玛的手。<br>|#0103Adv17_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:抱歉，让你担心了。<br>不过我现在感觉好多了。|#0103Adv17_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:可能是因为这段时间都没睡好，<br>经过长时间的休息，<br>艾玛感觉身体轻松了许多。|#0103Adv17_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Default

[PrintTextModified Text:你现在还不能动。<br>之前你一直在发高烧，说着胡话……|#0103Adv17_Meruru004| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:大家都非常担心你。<br>再加上，连雪莉小姐也……|#0103Adv17_Meruru005| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:欸！？<br>雪、雪莉她怎么了……！？|#0103Adv17_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

