[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛～！我在这里哦～！|#0103Adv17_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从隔壁床传来充满活力的声音，<br>艾玛转头望去。|#0103Adv17_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只见雪莉坐在床上，<br>左腿缠着厚厚的绷带。|#0103Adv17_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你受伤了！？|#0103Adv17_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:35,20 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1 SubId:Front

[PrintTextModified Text:是啊。刚刚出了点小意外。<br>所以才来医务室的。|#0103Adv17_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Sherry-Front,MainBackground-Front Lazy:false
@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground-Front Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0
