@Wait WaitMode:0.3

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:她、她伤得很重，<br>连我的治愈魔法都治不好……<br>请好好休息，雪莉小姐……！|#0103Adv17_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露语气变得严厉，<br>让想要起身的雪莉躺回床上。|#0103Adv17_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（雪莉到底怎么了……）|#0103Adv17_Ema006| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在艾玛想要开口询问时——|#0103Adv17_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙、玛格和可可鱼贯而入。<br>|#0103Adv17_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Surprised1,Option-ArmL-Off,ArmL4

[PrintTextModified Text:听说樱羽醒了，是真的吗！？|#0103Adv17_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6

[PrintTextModified Text:呼啊～别一大早就消息轰炸啊～<br>算了，我现在要睡咯。|#0103Adv17_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:我们都很担心你呢。<br>太好了，艾玛。<br>咦，雪莉也受伤了……？|#0103Adv17_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

