[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛查看自己的手机，<br>时间还不到6点，还没到早上开锁的时间。|#0103Adv17_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（感觉大家都开始在非放风时间里<br>　随意走动了……）|#0103Adv17_Ema007|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛看向梅露露，<br>后者露出苦笑。|#0103Adv17_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Meruru.Smile

[PrintTextModified Text:自从发现看守巡逻力度很松懈后，<br>大家就都不怎么待在牢房里了……|#0103Adv17_Meruru007| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:啊哈哈……<br>希望不会被发现然后被关进惩罚室。|#0103Adv17_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR7,ArmL6
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,ArmL2
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Smile1,ArmL3

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛，你发高烧出了很多汗，<br>一定很不舒服吧？<br>要我帮你擦擦身体吗♡|#0103Adv17_Margo002| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呜哇，好恶心……<br>艾玛亲，千万别让玛格碰你。<br>|#0103Adv17_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Smile1,ArmL1

[PrintTextModified Text:你饿了吧？<br>要我从食堂给你带点什么吗？|#0103Adv17_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家……|#0103Adv17_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我还以为嫌隙越来越深了，<br>　但大家都为我赶来了）|#0103Adv17_Ema010|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

