[PrintTextModified Text:少女们聚在一起，<br>房间立刻变得热闹而明亮。|#0103Adv17_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:对艾玛来说，<br>这是一幅几乎让她落泪的幸福景象。|#0103Adv17_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我们之间是有感情的）|#0103Adv17_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:有梅露露、有雪莉、<br>有玛格、有可可、有亚里沙。|#0103Adv17_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛那一度几乎破碎的梦想，<br>在这幅景象中重现。|#0103Adv17_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家和睦相处，开怀大笑，<br>过着快乐的日子——|#0103Adv17_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:除此之外什么都不需要。<br>这就是艾玛小小的、小小的梦想。|#0103Adv17_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我们还来得及……）|#0103Adv17_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:7_2 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:咦……|#0103Adv17_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这时，艾玛察觉到这幅景象中的违和感。|#0103Adv17_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:…………|#0103Adv17_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:（——少了一个人）|#0103Adv17_Ema015| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:要是没有注意到就好了。|#0103Adv17_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:黑暗的迷雾在胸中急速蔓延，<br>艾玛无法抑制地感到不安。|#0103Adv17_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:就在这时，<br>一丝焦糊的气味飘进艾玛的鼻子。|#0103Adv17_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_27_2 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:这个气味……是什么……？|#0103Adv17_Ema016| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの通知音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_14 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:手机的通知响起，<br>少女们同时查看屏幕。|#0103Adv17_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『抱歉这么早打扰你们……有事要通知大家。<br>　招待所那边似乎起火了……』<br>|#0103Adv17_Narrative025|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"『我们派人手去灭火，<br>　请大家注意安全。<br>　唉，麻烦死了……』|#0103Adv17_Narrative026|" RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:火灾……？|#0103Adv17_Ema017| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:火不会烧到这边来吧？|#0103Adv17_Coco004| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1,ArmR1,ArmL1 SubId:Middle

[PrintTextModified Text:真让人担心。去看看吧。|#0103Adv17_Margo004| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格、可可和亚里沙朝医务室门口走去。|#0103Adv17_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3 SubId:Middle

