[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙急忙抓住艾玛的手腕，<br>但艾玛甩开了她的手。|#0103Adv17_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛的眼睛死死盯着<br>燃烧的招待所。|#0103Adv17_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:樱羽，你到底……|#0103Adv17_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……因为，少了一个人。<br>　应该在这里的人，不在这里）|#0103Adv17_Ema019|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……不会的吧？<br>　一定是我想多了吧？）|#0103Adv17_Ema020|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:燃烧的是离她们最近的房间——<br>火精之室。|#0103Adv17_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正如其名，整栋楼都被火焰包围。|#0103Adv17_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:幸好火势主要在建筑周围，<br>入口处暂时还安全。|#0103Adv17_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛伸手握住紧闭的门把手。|#0103Adv17_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆痛そうに

[PrintTextModified Text:……|#0103Adv17_Ema021| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:门把手烫得吓人，灼伤了艾玛的手。<br>而且门还上了锁，打不开。|#0103Adv17_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:喂樱羽快让开！门我来开！|#0103Adv17_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCamera Offset:0,0 Zoom:0 EasingTypeName:SmoothStep Duration:0.9 Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙冲上前，大喊道。|#0103Adv17_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 放たれた炎の音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_46 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛急忙闪开，<br>亚里沙对着门释放出强烈的火焰。|#0103Adv17_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:本就受高温侵蚀的门，<br>在火焰的烧灼下逐渐崩塌。|#0103Adv17_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopBgm

[PrintTextModified Text:——接着。|#0103Adv17_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那幅景象映入了艾玛的眼帘。<br>|#0103Adv17_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

